OL,3,GNEWSAHalle return brings history full
OL,4,Acircle for venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA world-renowned orchestra is set to
OL,7,Freturn to a stage it first performed on
OL,8,Fmore than a century ago.
OL,10,FThe Halle will headline the Grand Civic
OL,11,FReopening following Blackburn's King
OL,12,FGeorge's Hall's #13.5m transformation.
OL,14,FThe performance comes about 105 years
OL,15,Fafter the orchestra played at the
OL,16,Fhall's official opening in October
OL,17,F1921.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
