OL,3,GNEWSAHalle return brings history full
OL,4,Acircle for venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Quesir Mahmood, said: "From
OL,7,Fone-penny programmes to Star Wars and
OL,8,FSkyfall, the Halle's return perfectly
OL,9,Fcaptures the transformation of King
OL,10,FGeorge's Hall, celebrating its heritage
OL,11,Fwhile looking firmly to the future."
